index 95f68e3..8cb7a5f 100644
--- a/apps/zcode-cli/docs/provider-subscriptions.md
+++ b/apps/zcode-cli/docs/provider-subscriptions.md
@@ -490,3 +490,41 @@ Historical usage reads do not require a configured model or active conversation.
 local control-plane carrier (also used by global workflows) when no reusable local workspace client
 exists. Read the same Session SQLite ledger over v4/usage/stats; do not select an arbitrary remote
 workspace, create a conversation, start inference or add another storage owner.
+
+### CC Switch import correction
+
+Read the external database in one read-only transaction. Translate the source client's actual wire
+URL semantics, not just its displayed base URL: Claude's Chat/Responses proxy adds /v1, while Codex
+adds it only to a bare origin. Strip Claude's local [1M] marker before deduplicating upstream model
+IDs; the marker alone does not prove a context limit. Include explicit catalog and subagent models.
+Import API-key configurations whose declared protocol is supported, including compatible Claude
+Desktop/OpenCode/Pi/OpenClaw shapes; reject OAuth, scripts and unrepresentable per-model routes.
+
+Match existing connections by protocol, credential and canonical/source URL in ProviderSettings,
+not a process-local imported-ID map. Reimport completes the same connection, preserves disabled
+models/manual corrections/defaults and retries missing model writes. Exact known endpoint templates
+supply brand/key-management metadata and plan categorization without inheriting template model lists;
+arbitrary names/hosts do not. Same-key connections across catalog-proven equivalent service routes
+are already bound: retain their current protocol rather than creating or switching a route.
+Selected repair disables erroneous local-marker aliases after their canonical model exists, without
+deleting historical model data. No source changes, inference or default-account/model changes.
+
+Preview → existing ProviderSettings owner → connection/model writes → refreshed settings/picker.
+The preview shows converted protocol/models and whether the selected existing connection is completed.
+A missing upstream model-list endpoint is a localized informational state, not a broken saved key.
+
+
+### Billing and projectless usage correction (OV-052)
+
+Provider-reported billing periods/currency reuse the existing subscription metadata cache and
+account/revision check. A one-period active_start/active_until can prefill the existing fee form;
+long-running subscription start dates cannot stand in for a current billing cycle. Preserve exact
+absolute boundaries unless the user edits dates, and reject late metadata after account or field
+changes. Discounts and list prices never become actual payments without an invoice fact.
+Current live ChatGPT responses expose dates/currency/discounts but no amount paid. No payment is
+automatically fabricated or saved. Amount acquisition remains incomplete for these responses.
+
+Project cost projection uses the existing registered local project list. Conversation backing roots,
+unregistered paths and null history group under Other without rewriting immutable usage facts or
+removing them from account-period allocation. Agent-editable statistics must reuse the existing
+Session/permission and Settings owners; that contextual bridge is not implemented by this change.
